msgctxt "76"
msgid "Master Utabori... Sorry to intrude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Kiryu? What brings you here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"I was wondering if you'd work on a tattoo for my friend here. His name's "
"Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "A friend, hm? Interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"His artist passed away before he could get his tattoo finished... so we were"
" hoping your needle might be the one for the job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but you'll need to find someone else if that's what you want. I "
"can't add to another artist's work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Listen well, Kiryu. A tattoo changes a man's life. You know that better than"
" anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"The creator and the receiver must both be prepared to bear the lifelong "
"responsibilities that tattoo brings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "So I'm sorry, but the answer must be no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Call me a stubborn old man if you wish, but this is something I won't "
"compromise on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Okay. We'll find someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Hey, hold on a sec! You're just gonna refuse before you even see the damn "
"thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "You're not an artist, you're a coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Rikiya, that's enough!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Sorry, Aniki, but I can't let this go. That viper is the soul of Okinawa! "
"How can he talk like that if he won't even look at my tattoo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"I admire your spirit, boy, but don't presume to lecture me on my own trade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Fine then, I'll just show you! Take a look at this!"
msgstr ""

